{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qznqQYrbTa1795594378.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本福岡市一個大型商場附近，一名男子被人用刀刺死，疑犯在逃。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.STAB-1600.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264QVeKNfoNr1795594386.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>現場是永旺夢樂城福岡伊都店，附近一個單車停泊區。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.STAB-1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026miv2IkKlYx1795594383.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方當地下午12時半接報，指一名男子在上址被刺傷，他送院時已經失去意識，經搶救後證實不治。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T08:43:53.976231+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T07:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T20:28:32.968066+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T08:37:17.472013+00:00","content_hash":"939852fca226c6e6efe623a7954994f25c5315bbeeb112abe01ec7b1cdf567a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T08:43:53.976231+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}